---
title: MF-01 · Client creates and submits a job
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant FE as Web App
  participant API as JobEndpoints
  participant H as CreateJob / SubmitJob handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  CL->>FE: Fill job form, MUST/SHOULD requirements, proposed terms
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs (JWT)
  API->>H: Send(CreateJobCommand)
  H->>DB: Check company VERIFIED and can_submit for the service type
  H->>DB: Insert Job (DRAFT) + JobRequirements, AuditLog
  API-->>FE: 201 Created
  CL->>FE: Submit for review
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/submit (ConcurrencyToken)
  API->>H: Send(SubmitJobCommand)
  alt no MUST_HAVE requirement or stale token
  API-->>FE: 400 / 409 with error code
  else valid
  H->>DB: Job → PENDING_REVIEW, JobStatusHistory, AuditLog
  API-->>FE: 200 OK
  end
